- `ProjectSetupScreen` is the **4th priority screen**, shown only when `status === "uninitialized"` and all higher-priority conditions (missing API key, missing models, CLI errors) are resolved.
- `refresh()` (from `useAppInit`) is the **universal re-init function** that re-checks the entire system state, allowing the UI to transition from any error/setup screen back to the main chat UI.[stage] run_soul_finished

